{"id":"en_the-devil-wears-desire","title":"The Devil Wears Desire","titleEn":"The Devil Wears Desire","description":"A woman whose heart is failing finds herself at the center of a perilous four-way tangle of love. Her childhood sweetheart has lost his memory, while a cold billionaire hides what he truly feels. A merciless playboy heir also pursues her, and an obsessive crime lord enters her life carrying a transplanted heart. As she moves through a maze of secret contracts, false identities and warped passions, she is caught in a high-stakes struggle for both love and survival.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-devil-wears-desire/en_US/c69ae2d39bc7c269/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-devil-wears-desire/en_US/c69ae2d39bc7c269/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv07c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-devil-wears-desire_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv07c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-devil-wears-desire_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv07c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-devil-wears-desire_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv07c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-devil-wears-desire_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv07c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-devil-wears-desire_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1